s sample CSV (Products → Import) and match its structure (e.g., handle, vendor, published, etc.).\n- CSV is text-only; host images first (Shopify Files/CDN or existing site) and reference them by image URLs.\n- Treat each row as a variant; reuse the same Handle for all rows of a single product.\n- Image handling: include URLs; Shopify attaches by Handle, but mapping different images per color may require extra care or scripting.\n\nFor complex variant images or very large catalogs:\n- Consider apps/PIMs (product information management): Matrixify (Excelify), Ablestar Bulk Product Editor, EZ Importer.\n\nNotable advice:\n- Read the official guide thoroughly and search existing resources to avoid pitfalls.\n\nStatus: Guidance provided; no confirmation from the original poster. Discussion remains open.","algorithm":"gpt-5","outdated":false,"created_at":"2025-12-11T10:21:18.843Z","updated_at":"2025-12-11T10:21:18.843Z"},"is_category_expert_question":null,"has_livestream":null,"livestream_chat_active":false,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","laughing","open_mouth","clap","confetti_ball","hugs"],"has_accepted_answer":false,"shared_issue_count":0,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":true,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":6353,"username":"PaulNewton","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/paulnewton/{size}/81148_2.png","post_count":1,"primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":2},{"id":614852,"username":"EFOLI-Syn","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/efoli-syn/{size}/19237_2.png","post_count":1,"primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"